OL,3,GNEWSAAnother man admits raping woman
OL,4,Adrugged by husband over 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother man has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fraping a woman who was drugged and
OL,8,Fabused by her husband without her
OL,9,Fknowledge for over 20 years.
OL,11,FGraham Brougham, 74, is the oldest of
OL,12,F13 men who were charged with sexual
OL,13,Foffences against the victim after being
OL,14,Fallegedly invited into her home, in the
OL,15,FStockport area of Greater Manchester,
OL,16,Fto abuse her by her husband.
OL,18,FThe husband, in his sixties, has
OL,19,Falready admitted 62 offences against
OL,20,Fhis wife - including rape - and has
OL,21,Fgiven a witness statement detailing
OL,22,F"what he says happened".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
